  "Organized Campaign Management": "إدارة الحملات المنظمة",
  "Managing multiple campaigns can be challenging, but the Campaign Module keeps everything organized. The module provides a centralized dashboard where you can monitor the progress of all your campaigns, manage tasks, and track milestones. This organized approach helps you stay on top of deadlines, coordinate team efforts, and ensure that each campaign runs smoothly from start to finish.": "قد تكون إدارة حملات متعددة أمرًا صعبًا، لكن وحدة الحملة تحافظ على تنظيم كل شيء. ",
  "Performance Tracking": "تتبع الأداء",
